## 4. DESIGN DIRECTION

### 4.1 Philosophy
Modern, clean, minimal, premium, trustworthy, institutional. Information-focused, consistent, responsive, accessible, fast.

**Avoid:** excessive gradients, unnecessary animation, too many colors, overcrowded dashboards, giant decorative cards, heavy shadows, random icons, generic AI aesthetics, empty sections, fake statistics presented as real.

### 4.2 Logo and palette (from the school logo)
The logo (circular emblem) has: deep blue Bangla school name, gold/tan double ring and ribbon, cyan laurel wreath, red candle with rays over an open book and pen, red stars. Save it as `/public/logo.png`. Show it in header, footer, login pages, sidebar, favicon and on every printed document.

