## 17. FUNCTIONALITY REQUIREMENTS

Not static screenshots. Working interactions: navigation and transitions, sidebar collapse, search, filters (URL state), pagination, table sorting, tabs, dropdowns, dialogs, form validation, file upload preview, date selection, theme and language switching, toasts, confirmation dialogs, chart filters, academic year / class / section / student selection, result filtering, attendance status selection, profile menu, mobile navigation, command palette.

Every list: skeleton loading, empty state with CTA, error state with retry. Every form: inline validation (messages in the active language), disabled-while-submitting, unsaved-changes warning. Bangla-first: labels, dates (`১৯ নভেম্বর ২০২৬`), numerals and number formatting via helpers. Never show raw UUIDs to users.

